      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why the algorithm stops\nEvery edge into t is full:\nb\u2192t 10/10, c\u2192t 3/3, e\u2192t 9/9.\nSo Gf has no edge entering t,\nand no augmenting path exists.\n\nReachable from s in Gf:\nS = {s, a, b, c, d, e},  T = {t}\n\nMin cut = capacity of edges S \u2192 T:\nc(b,t) + c(c,t) + c(e,t)\n= 10 + 3 + 9 = 22\n\n|f| = 22 = cut capacity, so 22 is optimal",
      "originalText": "Why the algorithm stops\nEvery edge into t is full:\nb\u2192t 10/10, c\u2192t 3/3, e\u2192t 9/9.\nSo Gf has no edge entering t,\nand no augmenting path exists.\n\nReachable from s in Gf:\nS = {s, a, b, c, d, e},  T = {t}\n\nMin cut = capacity of edges S \u2192 T:\nc(b,t) + c(c,t) + c(e,t)\n= 10 + 3 + 9 = 22\n\n|f| = 22 = cut capacity, so 22 is optimal",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "ch12-13-ff-final-residual-min-cut-n7",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 15
    }
